      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been a bug with worlds where you are far from origin since the ability to force camera near distance was added. Due to it not being saved previously it generally wasn't an issue as you'd need to manually force the setting in every world and most advanced users would think twice before setting forced on in a world where you may be far from origin. Now that it's saved though, it'll be more likely for users who like to use this setting to run into this edge case.\n\nOne of the worlds I'm working on makes it impossible to use the menu at spawn with forced near distance so I'm planing to make a failsafe system that detects if you're using the setting and teleports you to a safety box near origin so you can either change the setting or leave if needed.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
